{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23973","headline":"和微之道保生三日 · 白居易","name":"和微之道保生三日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相看鬓似丝，始作弄璋诗。\n且有承家望，谁论得力时。\n莫兴三日叹，犹胜七年迟。\n我未能忘喜，君应不合悲。\n嘉名称道保，乞姓号崔儿。\n但恐持相竝，蒹葭琼树枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}